[en.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_FACTORY]
Apple Family Factory

[en.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_FACTORY_desc]
There is another important purpose of this reunion: with the support of the Pie family in the quarry farm, we will vigorously develop heavy industry, build new military factories, and get rid of the long-term dependence of the Apple family on agriculture and light industry. Members of the Apple family from allover the world should contribute to this.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_FACTORY]
苹果家族工厂

[zh.FOCUS_C14_FAMILY_FACTORY_desc]
此次团聚还有一个重要的目的：在采石农场的派家族支援下，我们要大力发展重工业，新建军事工厂，摆脱苹果家族长期以来只依赖于农业和轻工业的状态。来自世界各处的苹果家族成员都应该为此贡献一份自己的力量。

